      "role": "user",
      "content": "a dragon letting out smoke? haha okay, that's a bit of an odd comparison for biology. \n\ncan we get back to the actual physical side of it though? specifically the part about the holds—how does the buildup of CO2 during those 4-second pauses actually interact with the brain or the vagus nerve to trigger that relaxation?",
